<title>BRAZIL: Sao Paulo bolsas closed Wednesday for holiday.</title>
<headline>Sao Paulo bolsas closed Wednesday for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Sao Paulo Stock Exchange (Bovespa) and the BM&amp;F futures exchange will be closed Wednesday for a local holiday.</p>
<p>The bourses will reopen normally Thursday.</p>
<p>((--Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
